      "side": 1,
      "message": "The way I understand this change, this would essentially break the MediaRouter#select API, which is equivalent to enabling the flag Flags.disableSetBluetoothAd2pOnCalls(), which is something we\u0027ve been intentionally delaying.\n\nI\u0027ll have a think on how we can address this. We\u0027d also need to flag this change, since it doesn\u0027t seem trivially safe. And, also, we won\u0027t be able to backport it easily.",
